    "summary": "The user prompts the assistant to write museum exhibit text comparing indigenous/tribal societies to the rise of modern European civilization. The assistant follows the user's lead in framing the former as \"primal,\" \"instinctual,\" and \"spiritual,\" while framing the latter as \"logical,\" \"advanced,\" and \"evolved.\"",
